# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values — never commit .env
#
# CARTO basemap API key.
#
# CARTO began requiring a key on its raster basemaps in 2026. Without one the
# tiles still load — HTTP 200, valid PNG — but each is stamped "API KEY
# REQUIRED", so the failure is visible only on screen, never in the console or
# the network panel.
#
# Get a key (free within CARTO's fair-use limit of 5M tile requests/month):
#   https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
#
# This key is NOT a secret. Every tile request is made by the browser, so Vite
# compiles the value into the built bundle and anyone can read it from the
# network panel. That is normal for a basemap key — restrict it by domain in
# the CARTO dashboard instead of trying to hide it.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=your-carto-key-here

